1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,265
Writing, task two. E-mail number 10: A wedding.

2
00:00:04,967 --> 00:00:15,372
Your friend has invited you to her wedding, but you can't come. Write her an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:25,101
Hi Petra,

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,587
Hi Petra, thank you very much for the invitation to your wedding.

5
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,706
Unfortunately I can't come because that day I'm flying to Ukraine to see my mum, she is ill.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,686
I'll send you a present by post, it's a set of glasses.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,175
We can meet for coffee next week, maybe on Wednesday.

8
00:00:40,467 --> 00:00:42,472
I wish you lots of love and happiness.

9
00:00:42,767 --> 00:00:43,862
Yours, Ivan

10
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:51,054
This e-mail has 49 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

11
00:00:51,767 --> 00:01:00,777
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
